Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.80,0:00:04.92,Default,,0,0,0,,懂了嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.92,0:00:08.93,Default,,0,0,0,,完全不懂
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.01,0:00:10.34,Default,,0,0,0,,我想也是
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.43,0:00:12.43,Default,,0,0,0,,畢竟是這麼舊型的速成學習儀器
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.47,0:00:14.47,Default,,0,0,0,,起得來嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.98,0:00:17.44,Default,,0,0,0,,我回來了？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.39,0:00:24.83,OPEDJP,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}Change! さぁ化けな Growl Growl Growl
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.90,0:00:30.53,OPEDJP,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}Change! 蛻變化身吧 Growl Growl Growl
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.52,0:00:33.42,OPEDJP,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}yeah
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.29,0:00:36.14,OPEDJP,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}ざばぁん
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.38,0:00:38.96,OPEDJP,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}潜伏しながら行こう
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.13,0:00:41.58,OPEDJP,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}Guess Doubt 壊れる思考
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.69,0:00:44.21,OPEDJP,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}人の殻破り 突き出る角
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.21,0:00:46.09,OPEDJP,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}正気はいらないさ
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.09,0:00:47.51,OPEDJP,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}I'll take you
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.51,0:00:48.84,OPEDJP,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}破れハウトゥー
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.84,0:00:51.68,OPEDJP,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}笑えるわ 裏切りだらけの生
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.68,0:00:52.84,OPEDJP,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}Bet on me
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.84,0:00:55.10,OPEDJP,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}吊し上げて堕とす
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.10,0:00:58.63,OPEDJP,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}それでは皆 Nice tripを
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.23,0:01:03.32,OPEDJP,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}手を伸ばしたその先に幸よあれ
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.32,0:01:04.52,OPEDJP,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}廻り廻って
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.52,0:01:05.91,OPEDJP,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}変わり変わる
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.91,0:01:08.01,OPEDJP,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}人の形捨て
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.42,0:01:09.67,OPEDJP,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}Get out!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.96,0:01:13.45,OPEDJP,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}救いよあれ 騙し騙されのゲーム
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.59,0:01:16.98,OPEDJP,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}一心不乱にあがいて 切り裂く逆境
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.98,0:01:19.41,OPEDJP,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}足元にTake care
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.41,0:01:20.43,OPEDJP,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}Get out!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.97,0:01:24.38,OPEDJP,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}憂いのない 電脳化されたHeaven
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.54,0:01:26.44,OPEDJP,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}一瞬の油断が最後
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.44,0:01:30.28,OPEDJP,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}剥ぎ取るよ化けの皮
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.28,0:01:33.25,OPEDJP,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}Get out!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.34,0:01:35.76,OPEDJP,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}Change! さぁ化けな Growl Growl Growl
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.76,0:01:38.68,OPEDJP,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}Get out!
